"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/area:%20core","name":"area: core","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":"Issues related to the framework runtime"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2017-10-24T16:25:31Z","updated_at":"2019-09-13T03:50:42Z","closed_at":"2017-12-15T15:53:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## I'm submitting a...\r\n<!-- Check one of the following options with \"x\" -->\r\n<pre><code>\r\n[ ] Regression (a behavior that used to work and stopped working in a new release)\r\n[x] Bug report  <!-- Please search GitHub for a similar issue or PR before submitting -->\r\n[ ] Feature request\r\n[ ] Documentation issue or request\r\n[ ] Support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n## Current behavior\r\nFollows #19485 \r\n\r\nI'm still having issues when beta testing `fullTemplateTypeCheck` (even if it's better than when I opened #19485 ), here are my findings.\r\n\r\nA simple template with a `routerLink`:\r\n```\r\n<a class=\"nav-item nav-link\" routerLink=\"/races\">Races</a>\r\n```\r\n throws:\r\n```\r\nDirective RouterLinkWithHref, Cannot find name '$event'. Did you mean 'Event'?\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith forms, too:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n  <div class=\"col-md-4 offset-md-4\">\r\n    <h1>Sign up</h1>\r\n\r\n    <form (ngSubmit)=\"register()\" [formGroup]=\"userForm\">\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\r\n        <label for=\"login\" id=\"login-label\">Login</label>\r\n        <input id=\"login\" class=\"form-control\" formControlName=\"login\">\r\n        <div *ngIf=\"loginCtrl.dirty && loginCtrl.hasError('required')\" id=\"login-warning\">Login is required</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\r\n        <label for=\"password\">Password</label>\r\n        <input id=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" type=\"password\" formControlName=\"password\">\r\n        <div *ngIf=\"passwordCtrl.dirty && passwordCtrl.hasError('required')\">Password is required</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\r\n        <label for=\"birthYear\">Birth year</label>\r\n        <input id=\"birthYear\" class=\"form-control\" type=\"number\" formControlName=\"birthYear\">\r\n        <div *ngIf=\"birthYearCtrl.dirty && birthYearCtrl.hasError('required')\">Birth year is required</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\" [disabled]=\"userForm.invalid\">Let's Go!</button>\r\n    </form>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\nraises:\r\n\r\n```\r\nregister.component.html(5,5): Directive FormGroupDirective, Cannot find name '$event'\r\nregister.component.html(9,9): Directive DefaultValueAccessor, Property '_handleInput' does not exist on type 'DefaultValueAccessor'.\r\nregister.component.html(9,9): Directive DefaultValueAccessor, Cannot find name '$event'.\r\nregister.component.html(9,9): Directive DefaultValueAccessor, Property '_compositionStart' does not exist on type 'DefaultValueAccessor'.\r\nregister.component.html(9,9): Directive DefaultValueAccessor, Property '_compositionEnd' does not exist on type 'DefaultValueAccessor'. Did you mean '_compositionMode'?\r\nregister.component.html(21,9): Directive ɵbc, Cannot find name '$event'\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\nAngular version: 5.0.0-rc.5\r\n \r\nFor Tooling issues:\r\n- Node version: v8.7\r\n- Platform:  Mac\r\n</pre></code>\r\n\r\ncc @chuckjaz ","closed_by":{"login":"alxhub","id":4175141,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzUxNDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4175141?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/us